== Effects ==
* If Isaac has less than one full {{E|Red Heart}} after taking damage, he will be immediately teleported to a random room.
** {{dlc|a+}} The teleportation happens only at half a heart or less left, regardless of health type. Empty {{E|Bone Heart|n}}s are not counted as health even if they can absorb a hit.

== Notes ==
* Does not affect {{C|The Lost}}, as being hit with {{i|Holy Mantle}} does not count as taking damage.
** {{dlc+|r}} It will affect Isaac with {{I|Spirit Shackles}}, teleporting the player out of the room and restoring the Holy Mantle charge.{{dlc-}}
* It is not recommended to have this item equipped during a boss fight as the boss's health will be restored to 100% if the player is teleported out of the room and returns, placing the player at a disadvantage.

== Synergies ==
* {{a|Golden Trinket|r+}} / {{i|Mom's Box|r+}}: Having either teleports Isaac to a random special room instead. Having both activates if Isaac has 1 full heart or less after taking damage.

== Interactions ==
* {{I|Scapular}}: Provided Scapular can always trigger, grants effective immortality, as the soul heart is always given before the teleport takes place.
** +{{I|The Wafer}}: Grants true immortality, plus one hit on the soul heart, allowing the player to get hit once before teleporting.

